OL,3,GNEWSATrain disruption after person dies
OL,4,Aon tracks                              
OL,6,FTrain services between Stevenage and   
OL,7,FLondon have been cancelled or delayed  
OL,8,Fafter a person was found dead on the   
OL,9,Ftracks.                                
OL,11,FBritish Transport Police said          
OL,12,Fparamedics attended the incident at    
OL,13,FKnebworth railway station at about     
OL,14,F10:00 GMT and the person was pronounced
OL,15,Fdead at the scene.                     
OL,17,FGreat Northern Rail and Thameslink said
OL,18,Fon their websites, all lines between   
OL,19,Fthe stations have now reopened, adding 
OL,20,Fpassengers should still expect trains  
OL,21,Fto be cancelled, delayed by up to an   
OL,22,Fhour, or diverted via Hertford North.  
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
